"Použiť viac sieťových ciest pre plynulú mobilitu (Linux 5.6+, iba vstavaný "
"režim)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:460
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/vnc.rs:296
msgid ""
"Multiple network paths (embedded mode only). Not available: kernel MPTCP is "
