msgid ""
"Use local security keys in the remote session (External client, FreeRDP 3.x)"
msgstr ""
"Používať miestne bezpečnostné kľúče vo vzdialenom sedení (externý klient, "
"FreeRDP 3.x)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:485
msgid "Admin/console session (/admin)"
msgstr "Relácia správcu/konzoly (/admin)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:487
msgid ""
"Connect to the console/admin session (External client). Bypasses RDS CAL "
"licensing"
msgstr ""
"Pripojiť k relácii konzoly/správcu (externý klient). Obchádza licencovanie "
"RDS CAL"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:492
msgid ""
"Passes /admin to the external FreeRDP client, connecting to the server's "
"console/administrative session instead of a normal RDS session. This "
"bypasses RDS CAL licensing. External client only; the embedded client cannot "
"request it yet."
msgstr ""
"Odovzdá /admin externému klientovi FreeRDP a pripojí sa ku konzolovej/"
"administratívnej relácii servera namiesto bežnej relácie RDS. Tým sa "
"obchádza licencovanie RDS CAL. Iba externý klient; vstavaný klient to zatiaľ "
"nedokáže vyžiadať."

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:503
msgid "Kerberos Authentication"
msgstr "Overovanie Kerberos"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:505
msgid ""
"Required for AD \"Protected Users\"; Host must be the server's DNS name. "
"Embedded client: Kerberos only, with the saved password. External client: "
"FreeRDP tries Kerberos itself, and RemoteApp is no longer limited to NTLM"
msgstr ""
"Vyžaduje sa pre AD „Protected Users“; Host musí byť DNS názov servera. "
"Vstavaný klient: iba Kerberos, s uloženým heslom. Externý klient: FreeRDP "
"sám skúša Kerberos a RemoteApp už nie je obmedzený na NTLM"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:517
msgid "KDC Address"
msgstr "Adresa KDC"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:519
msgid ""
"Optional. A domain controller name or IP address, a tcp:// or udp:// "
"address, or an https:// KDC proxy URL. Leave empty to find it automatically. "
"The External client uses only an https://…/KdcProxy proxy and otherwise "
"follows the system Kerberos configuration."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľné. Názov alebo IP adresa radiča domény, adresa tcp:// alebo udp:// "
"alebo URL proxy KDC https://. Ponechajte prázdne na automatické nájdenie. "
"Externý klient používa iba proxy https://…/KdcProxy, inak sa riadi "
"systémovou konfiguráciou Kerberosu."

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:534
msgid "Disable NLA"
msgstr "Zakázať NLA"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:535
msgid "Skip Network Level Authentication (less secure)"
msgstr "Preskočiť overenie na úrovni siete (menej bezpečné)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:551
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:553
